msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Though what good would that knowledge have done him?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫He had to hurry back "
"regardless."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ma a cosa gli sarebbe servito saperlo?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Doveva tornare indietro in ogni caso."

#: scenario2:scenario2_3380BD21_7C7C_4798_84A2_08A06159DE42
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ca81965444f2e9ac469a68e82537992824ca7ab3693b8a118159a4096d998746
