msgstr "⟪k:0⟫In quale direzione doveva dirigersi per tornare alla villa?"

#: scenario2:scenario2_3990E263_69AA_4FC5_88B9_662FEA8F802B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c04f88a7845102882235aac93ce5386c727b1782634fd9f5d79df98ceed5eb96
#. default-sha256: dca52197b6b681d209fd2a3a6931ac95fbfc2e0038f517735ffad1eecdfcacbf
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_3990E263_69AA_4FC5_88B9_662FEA8F802B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫He stormed through the forest, and eventually, the mansion appeared before him"
"—⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫like the world fading into view after a dream. ⟪k:6⟫Bestia was a tempest in the night, "
"blowing through the overgrowth toward the house."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Superò la vegetazione, e alla fine la villa apparve dinanzi a lui—⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫"
"⟪k:6⟫come il mondo che riemerge dopo un sogno.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Bestia era una tempesta nella notte che "
"tuonava attraverso la foresta."

#: scenario2:scenario2_EA847C11_5B15_4355_86CC_D779D64DACF8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
