msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ho bisogno della pace che mi procura!"

#: scenario2:scenario2_AFBC4D9F_D3B4_42C7_8555_FF3FEECD0463
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 63fddae12e4ebdc84e4dca8b5a1c371eb4ae34352ba089b3804343c6795892c6
