msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫In the blink of an eye, he was through the door, charging down the mansion’s halls."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫In un batter d’occhio, superò la porta d’ingresso, percorrendo furiosamente i "
"corridoi della villa."

#: scenario2:scenario2_661D5D51_C0CA_4BD0_AC8A_2B5045A5B24B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: de4ac01ebd028ac35523965414244f5c47c29ebaf96ba8813e5639408e070547
#. default-sha256: 772badb65c6077081d01e8cdbd20bfadea854f602cab84e907435b9ce2e7454b
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_661D5D51_C0CA_4BD0_AC8A_2B5045A5B24B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He could not sense anyone else inside, though. ⟪k:1⟫All he could hear was the ⟪k:2⟫"
"whoosh⟪k:3⟫ of the wind blowing into the house from somewhere."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ma non avvertiva la presenza di nessuno. ⟪k:1⟫Tutto quel che riusciva a sentire era il suono "
"del vento che soffiava da qualche parte nella casa."

#: scenario2:scenario2_F0F7C33E_EDE8_4694_BD76_088F43491772
